{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"x":0.009703592563473246,"y":0.0031134502135484743,"w":0.30295468648274743,"h":0.036469543367008805,"c":1,"t":"@MirsIELTS"},{"x":0.085920562130736233,"h":0.016666371843456096,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.04750506049921599,"c":1,"w":0.11974812825520834},{"w":0.049317255020141601,"y":0.097332560655132183,"h":0.0088232507396236448,"c":1,"t":"MARIE:","x":0.08622432925575306},{"w":0.047227926254272454,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"t":"COLIN:","c":1,"x":0.086242299608536729,"y":0.13662790697000848},{"w":0.049281314214070643,"t":"MARIE:","h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"x":0.086242299673609274,"y":0.16715116269007146},{"h":0.0087209302063888661,"c":1,"t":"COLIN:","x":0.086242299608536729,"w":0.047227926254272454,"y":0.19912790697000848},{"w":0.049281314214070629,"h":0.0072674416511108175,"c":1,"t":"MARIE.","x":0.086242299669145386,"y":0.21511627915930409},{"x":0.08606860531671387,"y":0.22915313886259625,"w":0.047575314839680999,"c":1,"t":"COLIN:","h":0.0097169780449881671},{"x":0.086242299669145386,"y":0.27616279069259053,"w":0.049281314214070629,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"t":"MARIE:","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.29069767428634052,"w":0.047227923075358072,"x":0.086242300577310735,"t":"COLIN:","h":0.0087209302063888661},{"y":0.30668604641100172,"w":0.049281314214070643,"t":"MARIE:","h":0.010174418761667026,"c":1,"x":0.086242299673609274},{"x":0.086242299608536729,"w":0.047227926254272454,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"y":0.33720930222394974,"t":"COLIN:"},{"y":0.35319767441092509,"w":0.049281314214070629,"t":"MARIE:","h":0.0087209302063888661,"c":1,"x":0.086242299664256353},{"x":0.086242299608536729,"t":"COLIN:","w":0.047227926254272454,"y":0.41424418603977586,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"c":1},{"w":0.050310567220052074,"x":0.085730233937870395,"t":"MARIE:","y":0.44448108604630765,"h":0.010819623603933404,"c":1},{"h":0.0093004086024641719,"c":1,"w":0.045390904744466137,"x":0.086134116317970799,"t":"COLIN:","y":0.46046607474903201},{"x":0.08398208711187341,"h":0.0125780662604138,"c":1,"w":0.051748352050781266,"y":0.47481561791061977,"t":"MARIE:"},{"y":0.52172346402389724,"x":0.084151999962709945,"c":1,"h":0.011785629857606228,"w":0.049355138142903654,"t":"COLIN:"},{"t":"MARIE:","c":1,"x":0.086227190751449953,"y":0.53774771612471428,"w":0.049311532974243164,"h":0.0088068931151983332},{"h":0.0090483645773918875,"c":1,"t":"COLIN:","x":0.086180320244489503,"y":0.55361535257595096,"w":0.045298496882120773},{"h":0.010174418761666804,"t":"MARIE:","y":0.58284883696122092,"c":1,"x":0.08624230190884212,"w":0.049281311035156247},{"x":0.086242299538594483,"y":0.60029069766768284,"w":0.045174538294474278,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"t":"COLIN:","c":1},{"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"Yes, there's all sorts of possibilities.","x":0.18275153621990151,"w":0.28336756388346351,"c":1,"y":0.095870206510527134},{"h":0.014749262536873142,"w":0.60369608561197907,"c":1,"x":0.18069815830564381,"t":"I was reading an article about food trends predicting how eating habits might","y":0.13510324488717806},{"x":0.18480492900283962,"y":0.15103244827791373,"h":0.011799410029498469,"t":"change in the next few years.","w":0.23203285217285158,"c":1},{"h":0.017353662136381676,"c":1,"t":"Oh - things like more focus on local products? That seems so obvious, but the","y":0.16453996718978225,"x":0.18267295609253276,"w":0.61617055257161457},{"x":0.1827515363580953,"w":0.28747433980305981,"h":0.013081395872223012,"c":1,"t":"shops are still full of imported foods.","y":0.18168604624482509},{"h":0.016478077711257311,"w":0.4129447174072266,"c":1,"y":0.19576282122124311,"x":0.18265190061431893,"t":"Yes, they need to be more proactive to address that."},{"y":0.21206755854161163,"x":0.18265147387801628,"h":0.014960224297897673,"c":1,"w":0.40472890218098956,"t":"And somehow motivate consumers to change, yes."},{"h":0.014575186872904267,"y":0.22819767462471452,"x":0.18275154560383347,"c":1,"t":"One thing everyone's aware of is the need for a reduction in unnecessary","w":0.57905543009440108},{"x":0.18275154719913794,"w":0.62833674112955729,"h":0.013081395872223012,"y":0.24418604624769502,"c":1,"t":"packaging - but just about everything you buy in supermarkets is still covered in"},{"x":0.18275152855050042,"w":0.44353185017903657,"c":1,"h":0.013100261181856698,"t":"plastic. The government needs to do something about it.","y":0.2587020646557352},{"w":0.23408625284830731,"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"Absolutely. It's got to change.","x":0.18275153463071481,"y":0.27463126842897267,"c":1},{"w":0.54825459798177079,"c":1,"t":"Do you think there'll be more interest in gluten- and lactose-free food?","x":0.18480493909946366,"h":0.013115696077149797,"y":0.28924418578235056},{"w":0.64078979492187504,"c":1,"x":0.18473786165292808,"h":0.014935584054232343,"t":"For people with allergies or food intolerances? I don't know. Lots of people I know","y":0.30370133692122092},{"y":0.31976401203643268,"w":0.39014373779296874,"h":0.014538313153922289,"c":1,"x":0.18069815251008645,"t":"have been buying that type of food for years now."},{"t":"Yes, even if they haven't been diagnosed with an allergy.","c":1,"w":0.4476386006673177,"h":0.014597482034238829,"x":0.18069815335310618,"y":0.33569321542715513},{"t":"That's right. One thing I've noticed is the number of branded products related to","x":0.18266076339124784,"y":0.34886635147589573,"w":0.62439732869466147,"h":0.017943119510436811,"c":1},{"t":"celebrity chefs - people watch them cooking on TV and then buy things like spice","y":0.36627906997395732,"w":0.64065709431966145,"h":0.014546888908453792,"x":0.1806981467786638,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"mixes or frozen foods with the chef's name on... Ibought something like that","x":0.18069815243608464,"y":0.38226744206706664,"w":0.61806981404622396},{"c":1,"y":0.39692599532603601,"x":0.18260736647539844,"h":0.013346322658842613,"t":"once, but I won't again.","w":0.18719430287679034},{"y":0.41268436572691714,"t":"Yeah - I bought a ready-made spice mix for chicken which was supposed to be","w":0.62628336588541667,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"x":0.18069815268114706},{"x":0.18064224955561467,"w":0.59561635335286456,"c":1,"y":0.42624560393165789,"t":"used by a chef I'd seen on television, and it didn't actually taste of anything.","h":0.017120031058612484},{"h":0.017441860412777732,"c":1,"t":"Mm. Did the article mention 'ghost kitchens' used to produce takeaway food?","x":0.18069816569617009,"y":0.4418604649244251,"w":0.6057494608561198},{"t":"No. What are they?","c":1,"y":0.45929203566331767,"w":0.15605749766031901,"x":0.18275153854013482,"h":0.014545173419963642},{"t":"Well, they might have the name of a restaurant, but actually they're a cooking","w":0.60780288696289053,"y":0.47374631272037004,"c":1,"h":0.016224188790560534,"x":0.18069814572073825},{"c":1,"h":0.014599196960089045,"x":0.18069815883467119,"y":0.48982558160204115,"t":"facility just for delivery meals - the public don't ever go there. But people aren't","w":0.62012318929036458},{"y":0.50581395322089096,"x":0.18069815511115175,"w":0.30184804280598954,"h":0.013081395872223012,"t":"aware of that - it's all kept very quiet.","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883302221635,"x":0.18275154380270503,"w":0.52156056722005206,"t":"So people don't realise the food's not actually from the restaurant?","y":0.52034883741577276},{"w":0.049281314214070643,"h":0.014534883302221635,"y":0.53633720947130514,"c":1,"t":"Right.","x":0.18275153988132881},{"x":0.18069813980884741,"y":0.55073746311065319,"c":1,"h":0.014749262536873253,"w":0.62217661539713542,"t":"Did you know more and more people are using all sorts of different mushrooms"},{"h":0.014555464100345472,"c":1,"x":0.18069815600220523,"t":"now, to treat different health concerns? Things like heart problems?","w":0.52977411905924487,"y":0.56686046532199963},{"w":0.34496920267740894,"h":0.014534883302221635,"y":0.5828488374139067,"x":0.1806981500886016,"c":1,"t":"Hmm. They might be taking a big risk there."},{"x":0.18069814587791797,"c":1,"y":0.59734513249045418,"w":0.41273101806640622,"h":0.01457347194705394,"t":"Yes, it's hard to know which varieties are safe to eat."},{"w":0.17933250427246092,"t":"Anyway maybe now..","x":0.18032399588360945,"y":0.61316084604891341,"h":0.017015594437410742,"c":1},{"w":0.039014374415079822,"t":"Q25","x":0.85420944537972898,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"y":0.16569767458873752},{"w":0.036960986455281564,"y":0.22965116305316979,"x":0.85420944507408647,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q26","c":1},{"x":0.85420944506804708,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943475,"t":"Q27","y":0.30668604677623756},{"y":0.38372093049262568,"w":0.036960986455281564,"t":"Q28","x":0.85215605697769792,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943475},{"x":0.85215605698373731,"t":"Q29","w":0.036960986455281675,"y":0.49273255840200703,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1},{"y":0.58430232584386754,"h":0.013081394746943475,"x":0.85215605698373731,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281675,"t":"Q30"},{"x":0.083975075782484226,"h":0.017486792820393116,"y":0.66058799892409925,"w":0.10720385233561197,"c":1,"t":"PART 4"},{"t":"For my presentation today, I'm going to talk about the Céide Fields in the northwest of","y":0.69174041272876674,"h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1,"w":0.68172485351562495,"x":0.086242295931815718},{"c":1,"t":"Ireland, one of the largest Neolithic sites in the world. I recently visited this site and observed","x":0.086242303639809281,"y":0.70639534856763608,"h":0.013081395872223012,"w":0.73305953979492178},{"x":0.086242311240528502,"w":0.5646817016601563,"c":1,"y":0.72238372066513301,"t":"the work that is currently being done by a team of archaeologists there.","h":0.013081395872223012},{"t":"The site was first discovered in the 1930s by a local teacher, Patrick Caulfield. He noticed","x":0.084188921471290618,"w":0.7104722595214843,"h":0.016012382507324174,"c":1,"y":0.74563953499915891},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883302221524,"w":0.70636550903320316,"t":"that when local people were digging in the bog, they were constantly hitting against what","y":0.76162790718375417,"x":0.082135520524134906},{"t":"seemed to be rows of stones. He realised that these must be walls and that they must be","y":0.7753047675466409,"w":0.70441914876302081,"h":0.014161208948906157,"x":0.086194736672909569,"c":1},{"y":0.79203539827999558,"h":0.013274336283185861,"x":0.084188914760367675,"w":0.70020533243815097,"c":1,"t":"thousands of years old for them to predate the bog which subsequently grew over them."},{"w":0.68583160400390619,"h":0.016056115929707682,"c":1,"x":0.084188920687676999,"t":"He wrote to the National Museum in Dublin to ask them to investigate, but no one took","y":0.81533923278733922},{"w":0.71457906087239587,"h":0.014749262536873142,"y":0.83126843665458472,"t":"him seriously. It wasn't until 40 years later, when Patrick Caulfield's son Seamus, who had","x":0.082135520796130762,"c":1},{"t":"become an archaeologist by then, began to explore further. He inserted iron probes into the","h":0.013081395872222901,"x":0.086242297187392389,"w":0.72279261271158857,"c":1,"y":0.84593023229366349},{"c":1,"y":0.86191860485826011,"h":0.014534883302221635,"x":0.084188909137720314,"t":"bog to map the formation of the stones, a traditional method which local people had always","w":0.72279261271158846},{"h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1,"t":"used for finding fuel buried in the bog for thousands of years. Carbon dating later proved that","x":0.084188903175998461,"y":0.87640118005539325,"w":0.73716634114583335},{"x":0.084188905725989971,"w":0.61601643880208323,"h":0.01327433628318575,"c":1,"t":"the site was over 5,000 years old and was the largest Neolithic site in Ireland.","y":0.89233038326870018},{"y":0.92296511654367941,"x":0.084188911187143611,"t":"102","c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"w":0.036960986455281578},{"c":1,"x":0.85215605697769792,"w":0.036960986455281564,"y":0.77906976770192804,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q31"},{"t":"Q32","h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.85215605698373731,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281675,"y":0.83139534909968138},{"c":1,"t":"Q33","x":0.85215605698373731,"y":0.86337209328572784,"w":0.036960986455281675,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"w":0.45294118245442705,"x":0.51176470218665204,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1,"y":0.94166666659226195}]}